+
+Added public `importTasks(list, text)` (src/domain/import.ts, exported from src/index.ts). One task per
+line as `title;priority;tags`; empty priority means normal, tags split on whitespace, blank lines skipped
+(but counted in line numbers, which start at 1). Returns `{ imported, rejected: [{ line, reason }] }`.
+Each line goes through `list.add`, so the existing validation and duplicate rules apply. Tests: test/import.test.ts.
